  "Name": "Kinect Googly Eyes",
  "Overview": "Kinect Googly Eyes turns an everyday object into an animated character. Scan the front and back of an object, add oversized moving eyes and give the resulting creature a voice. The character can then be used in playful performances and recordings. This Kinect Fun Labs activity combines object scanning with simple character animation.",
